over. Essentiality of the cover makes the lift $T_d\to P(A)$ surjective, and projectivity of $P(A)$ splits it. Therefore the projective summands of $T_d$ are exactly the covers of the standard-label simples, with positive multiplicities; they are injective as summands of $T_d$. It follows that every nonzero submodule $X\subseteq T_d$ has a nonzero standard-label simple socle. Exact $V$ and the nonvanishing already proved in step 1.18 then give $V(X)\ne0$. This proves the required detector; it does not assert that every composition factor of $T_d$ is standard or that $T_d$ generates the whole parabolic category. [F1, F4, F7, step 1.18, step 2.4, construct, algebra]
 
